{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vastophobia is a new game about exploring liminal and strange space's , focusing on atmosphere and mild threats (no jump scares here). Find out why you are here. where is your family. make your way through varied and disturbing environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558780/extras/gif_2.png?t=1741902622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use tools to evade enemies. no jump scares. you will always be able to see or hear the threats first</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558780/extras/gif_3.png?t=1741902622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World Story , follow how you arrived here. what happened to you and where is your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558780/extras/gif_1.png?t=1741902622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vastophbia is an early access game which focus's on atmosphere and soundscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">venture into the strange world of the In-Between and try to return to your family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music By\u00a0Scott Buckley - Composer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558780?t=1741902622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558780/bf63c12db9d1f9c1ca2e019ec550a4a4705adf37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741902622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558780/9fed2f663ff20be805910ee7b412f2a87fb771b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741902622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558780/9fed2f663ff20be8